    <mxCell id="zBuilder" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f8fa;strokeColor=#0e8088;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=center;spacingTop=6;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0b6167;" value="⑦ BUILDER  «Creational»  —  multi-criteria course search queries&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Requirement: &quot;Students can search for courses by department, course number, keyword, and instructor&quot; — four independent optional filters = 16 combinations.&lt;br&gt;Why: avoids telescoping constructors and nullable-parameter call sites; build() validates the invariants so an invalid query object can never exist (Fail Fast).&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="570" width="830" x="40" y="2070" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="SearchQueryBuilder" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#d6eef0;strokeColor=#0e8088;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;«interface»  — Builder&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;SearchQueryBuilder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;+ reset(): SearchQueryBuilder&lt;br&gt;+ department(d): SearchQueryBuilder&lt;br&gt;+ courseNumber(n): SearchQueryBuilder&lt;br&gt;+ keyword(k): SearchQueryBuilder&lt;br&gt;+ instructor(i): SearchQueryBuilder&lt;br&gt;+ build(): CourseSearchQuery&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;every step returns self — fluent chaining&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="150" width="300" x="60" y="2155" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="CourseSearchQueryBuilder" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0e8088;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ConcreteBuilder&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CourseSearchQueryBuilder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;- criteria: Map&amp;lt;Field, Object&amp;gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;+ semester(s) / school(s)&lt;br&gt;+ minOccupancy(pct)&lt;br&gt;+ withAvailableSeatsOnly()&lt;br&gt;+ build(): CourseSearchQuery&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;build() validates: at least one criterion&lt;br&gt;present · 0.0 ≤ minOccupancy ≤ 1.0 ·&lt;br&gt;semester not in the past&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="175" width="300" x="60" y="2390" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="CourseSearchQuery" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#d6eef0;strokeColor=#0e8088;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Product&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;— immutable&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CourseSearchQuery&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;all fields read-only — no setters&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;- department: String?&lt;br&gt;- courseNumber: String?&lt;br&gt;- keyword: String?&lt;br&gt;- instructor: String?&lt;br&gt;- semester: Semester?&lt;br&gt;- minOccupancy: float?&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;+ matches(section): bool&lt;br&gt;+ describe(): String&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;immutable, so it is safe to log, cache and pass to&lt;br&gt;the Reporting Service without defensive copying&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="250" width="330" x="480" y="2330" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="CatalogQueryDirector" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#d6eef0;strokeColor=#0e8088;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Director&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CatalogQueryDirector&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;- builder: SearchQueryBuilder&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;+ openSectionsFor(dept, sem)&lt;br&gt;+ taughtBy(instructor, sem)&lt;br&gt;+ overCapacityInSchool(school, 0.9)&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;holds the reusable construction recipes.&lt;br&gt;overCapacityInSchool() &lt;b&gt;is&lt;/b&gt; the §3.3 use case, so&lt;br&gt;student search and admin reporting share&lt;br&gt;one builder (DRY)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="175" width="330" x="480" y="2140" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="bImpl" edge="1" parent="1" source="CourseSearchQueryBuilder" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=0;endSize=14;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#0e8088;" target="SearchQueryBuilder">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="bBuilds" edge="1" parent="1" source="CourseSearchQueryBuilder" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=10;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#0e8088;fontSize=10;" target="CourseSearchQuery" value="&amp;laquo;creates&amp;raquo;">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="bDirects" edge="1" parent="1" source="CatalogQueryDirector" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=10;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#0e8088;fontSize=10;" target="SearchQueryBuilder" value="directs">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
        <Array as="points">
          <mxPoint x="390" y="2182" />
        </Array>
      </mxGeometry>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="bExample" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;dashed=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;Client-side call — the 3.1 use case&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;browse all computer science courses for the upcoming&lt;br&gt;semester that a specific professor teaches&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;query = (CourseSearchQuery.builder()&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;.department(&quot;Computer Science&quot;)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;.instructor(&quot;Prof. Silva&quot;)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;.semester(Semester.FALL_2026)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;.build())&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;vs. without Builder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;search(None, None, None, &quot;Prof. Silva&quot;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; FALL_2026, None, False)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;— a transposed argument is a silent bug, not an error&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="200" width="280" x="70" y="2665" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="zRejected" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#777777;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=center;spacingTop=6;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#444444;" value="⊘ PATTERNS CONSIDERED AND DELIBERATELY REJECTED&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;A justified rejection is a design decision. Recorded here so the reasoning is visible on the diagram, not only in the report.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="595" width="890" x="920" y="2070" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="rejSingleton" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;dashed=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#7a3330;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;«rejected»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;s&gt;Singleton — NotificationService&lt;/s&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;- instance: NotificationService&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;+ getInstance()&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Conflicts with 3 of the 5 SOLID principles:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;SRP&lt;/b&gt; — also manages its own lifecycle, so it&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;has two reasons to change&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DIP&lt;/b&gt; — getInstance() binds callers to a&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;concrete class, and the dependency is&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;invisible in the constructor signature&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OCP&lt;/b&gt; — cannot substitute a test double or&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;alternative dispatcher without editing&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;the accessor&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Plus global mutable state and test leakage.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="215" width="400" x="1200" y="2140" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="compRoot" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;✔ What we do instead — Composition Root&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;composition_root.py constructs &lt;b&gt;exactly one&lt;/b&gt; NotificationPublisher and&lt;br&gt;injects that same reference into every collaborator:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;publisher = NotificationPublisher()&lt;br&gt;publisher.attach(SEAT_RELEASED, WaitlistObserver(..))&lt;br&gt;facade = EnrollmentFacade(validator, tx, publisher, repo)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Same uniqueness guarantee, &lt;b&gt;no global access point&lt;/b&gt;, no&lt;br&gt;hidden dependency, every dependency visible in the&lt;br&gt;constructor. This is the &lt;i&gt;single-instance lifestyle&lt;/i&gt;, not the&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Singleton pattern&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;A Python module is already a singleton, so a hand-written&lt;br&gt;getInstance() would also be un-idiomatic here.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="145" width="400" x="1200" y="2460" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="rejArrow" edge="1" parent="1" source="rejSingleton" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" target="compRoot" value="replaced by">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="rejOthers" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#777777;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=10;dashed=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;Also evaluated and rejected&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;— full reasoning in §6 of 01-design-patterns.md&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Abstract Factory&lt;/b&gt; one product family only, so Factory Method is the right granularity (YAGNI)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Decorator&lt;/b&gt; for chaining validation rules — a decorator chain short-circuits, but the requirement benefits from reporting &lt;u&gt;every&lt;/u&gt; failure&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Proxy&lt;/b&gt; lazy roster loading — no requirement drives it; premature optimisation (KISS)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Template Method&lt;/b&gt; report skeleton — closest call; the four reports differ in aggregation shape, not in one substitutable step&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Chain of Responsibility&lt;/b&gt; approval escalation — the university has single-administrator approval, not a hierarchy" vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="105" width="1350" x="390" y="2690" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="crossRef" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;How the patterns collaborate at run time&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(see diagram 05 — Sequence)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EnrollmentFacade&lt;/b&gt; ⑥ &amp;nbsp;→&amp;nbsp; asks &lt;b&gt;EnrollmentValidator&lt;/b&gt; ① to run every &lt;b&gt;ValidationRule&lt;/b&gt; ①&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→&amp;nbsp; wraps the state changes in an &lt;b&gt;AddCourseCommand&lt;/b&gt; ② handed to &lt;b&gt;TransactionManager&lt;/b&gt; ②&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→&amp;nbsp; on commit, publishes a domain event through &lt;b&gt;NotificationPublisher&lt;/b&gt; ④&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→&amp;nbsp; each &lt;b&gt;EventObserver&lt;/b&gt; ④ reacts independently.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;GradeSubmission&lt;/b&gt; ③ moves Draft → PendingApproval → Submitted, delegating every transition to its current &lt;b&gt;GradeState&lt;/b&gt; ③. &lt;b&gt;ReportFactory&lt;/b&gt; ⑤ and &lt;b&gt;CourseSearchQueryBuilder&lt;/b&gt; ⑦ are invoked independently by the Administrator and Student modules." vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="145" width="1350" x="390" y="2810" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
  </root>
</mxGraphModel>
